- Keep all 24 banked branch identities.
- Record constructive witnesses, incompatibilities, member dependence, and missing evidence.
- Do not reward resemblance to terrestrial, micro, cosmological, particle, force, or CMB behaviour.
- Do not erase holonomy to manufacture endpoint descent.
- Do not use a desired terminal reciprocal law to select its own input relation.

