   207	ambient holonomy proves that generally
   208	
   209	```text
   210	U_gamma X_lambda(p) U_gamma^-1 != X_lambda(q).
   211	```
   212	
   213	Consequently two distinct B states coexist:
   214	
   215	1. the calibration grading carried from A along `gamma`; and
   216	2. the intrinsic grading rebuilt from the complete metric at B.
   217	
   218	The transition
   219	
