   221	M_B: X_B^carried -> X_B^intrinsic
   222	```
   223	
   224	is not supplied by the current branch evidence. Setting it to identity would erase the measured
   225	holonomy and violate the three-observer audit. Inserting an arbitrary reciprocal reset changes the
   226	composite and the scalar depth; an exact catch proof retains this obstruction.
